WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.160 --> 00:00:03.560
Rocket?

00:00:03.740 --> 00:00:05.100
Rocket, are you there?

00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:13.600
What are you doing Peter?

00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:17.600
Dance with me

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:19.280
I'm not going to dance with you

00:00:19.460 --> 00:00:20.580
This is Sam Cooke

00:00:21.760 --> 00:00:24.040
One of the greatest
earth singers of all time

00:00:54.040 --> 00:00:55.780
Drax thinks you're not a dancer

00:00:57.020 --> 00:01:00.800
If you ever tell anyone about this,
I will kill you

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:02.940
Hope you're ready

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:04.620
It'll be here any minute

00:01:05.840 --> 00:01:06.880
Is that a rifle?

00:01:06.880 --> 00:01:08.240
You don't know
what a rifle looks like?

00:01:10.600 --> 00:01:12.580
it's just swords were
your thing and guns were mine

00:01:12.580 --> 00:01:14.540
But I guess we're both
doing guns now

00:01:14.540 --> 00:01:15.500
I just didn't know that

00:01:17.120 --> 00:01:18.400
Oh, that's intense

00:01:18.960 --> 00:01:20.600
Arrrghh

00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:22.840
[Evil laugh]

00:01:23.220 --> 00:01:23.780
[music]

00:01:28.040 --> 00:01:29.440
I see it within you

00:01:30.360 --> 00:01:30.980
Fear

00:01:31.640 --> 00:01:32.380
Jealousy

00:01:33.480 --> 00:01:34.480
Betrayal

00:01:35.540 --> 00:01:36.820
It is our duty

00:01:37.380 --> 00:01:40.420
To cleanse the universe of this weakness

00:01:40.760 --> 00:01:43.580
You know, they told me you people
were conceited douchbags

00:01:43.660 --> 00:01:45.340
But that isn't true at all

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:46.660
Dude

00:01:46.660 --> 00:01:48.140
Arh, I'm using my wrong eye

00:01:49.860 --> 00:01:51.700
Groot, put your seatbelt on

00:02:02.400 --> 00:02:04.420
So we're saving
the galaxy again?

00:02:05.460 --> 00:02:05.960
Yeap

00:02:06.700 --> 00:02:07.260
Awesome

00:02:07.820 --> 00:02:12.140
We're really going to be able to jack up our
price as two time galaxy savers

00:02:22.780 --> 00:02:24.480
Die spaceship!

00:02:27.200 --> 00:02:27.700
Fight!

00:02:40.700 --> 00:02:44.540
Sometimes the thing you're
searching for your whole life

00:02:44.540 --> 00:02:46.940
it's right there by your side all along

00:02:47.260 --> 00:02:48.140
You're right

00:02:50.060 --> 00:02:51.800
All you do is yell at each other

00:02:52.080 --> 00:02:53.360
You're not friends

00:02:55.320 --> 00:02:57.160
No, we're family

00:03:00.940 --> 00:03:02.220
Except maybe her

00:03:09.600 --> 00:03:12.840
After all these years, I've found you

00:03:13.400 --> 00:03:15.000
And who the hell are you?

00:03:16.460 --> 00:03:17.920
I'm your dad Peter

